{"n": 94, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "94.webp", "text": "11-—56a\n\n1100050 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nENGINE\n\nSince 1988 Models;\n\nDisconnect battery ground lead.\n\nRemove transmission - sce Gr. 23/24.\nring:\n\nUnscrew power steering pump.\n\nHoses remain connected.\n\nInstallation\n\nTighten drive belt and check tightness\n\nwith Special Tool 11 5 020.\n\nUnscrew plug and drain coolant.\nRemove radiator - see 17 11 000.\nRemove fan - see 11 52 000.\n\nCars with Air Conditioner:\n\nUnscrew compressor.\n\nHoses remain connected on\ncompressor.\n\nInstallation:\n\nTighten drive belt and check tightness\nwith Special Tool 11 5 020.\n\nDisconnect support and gas pressure.\nprop, and prop engine hood with\nSpecial Too! 51 2 120.\n\nCaution!\n\nUse retainer (1).\n\nInstallation:\n\nInsert plastic part (2).\n\nDisconnect throttle cable (1).\n\nCars with Cruise Control;\n\nDisconnect cruise control cable (2).\nCars with Automatic Transmission;\nDisconnect throttle cable (3).\ninstallation\n\nAdjust throttle cable - see Gr. 35.\nAdjust crulse control cable - see Gr. 65.\nAdjust throttle cable - see Gr. 24.\n\nPull off plug (1).\n\nLoosen clamp (2).\n\nUnscrew nuts (3) and lift out air cleaner\nwith alr flow sensor.\n\nPull off hose (4).\n\nPull off plug (5).\n\nDisconnect diagnosis plug (1).\nDisconnect hoses (2 and 3).\nUnscrew fuel pipe (4).\n\nLoosen holder (5).\n\nLoosen fuel hose clamp.\n\nDisconnect plugs (6 and 7).\n\nUnscrew holder for oil dipstick guide\ntube.\n\nUnscrew bolts (1 and 2) for water pipe\nand take off water pipe.", "words": [["11-—56a", 0.4701, 0.0298, 0.5471, 0.0537], ["1100050", 0.2806, 0.0769, 0.3303, 0.0875], ["REMOVING", 0.3384, 0.0763, 0.3982, 0.0875], ["AND", 0.4027, 0.0763, 0.426, 0.0869], ["INSTALLING", 0.4301, 0.0763, 0.497, 0.0875], ["ENGINE", 0.3384, 0.0928, 0.3804, 0.1041], ["Since", 0.2796, 0.126, 0.3835, 0.1393], ["1988", 0.3146, 0.1233, 0.3379, 0.1459], ["Models;", 0.3435, 0.126, 0.3835, 0.1393], ["Disconnect", 0.2796, 0.1432, 0.34